{"c":[{"id":"d133a7aa26b2284c","sum":"DuckDB 1.5.4 VSS post-filters WHERE after HNSW: a harness predicate plus ORDER BY distance LIMIT can return zero rows. Semantic tsv/table put session_id and message_id before role, a breaking shift marked chore(semantic)! so release-please cut 2.0.0.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T180756Z-1e00dec009646749","text":"DuckDB 1.5.4 VSS post-filters WHERE after HNSW: embeddings harness predicate plus ORDER BY distance LIMIT can return zero rows while matches exist.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T181638Z-94dbcd6e44d4af97","text":"Default semantic tsv and table insert session_id and message_id before role. That shift is breaking: marker commit chore(semantic)! so release-please cuts 2.0.0, not 1.3.0.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"8b5dfc860fd2304a","sum":"semantic --harness/--role rank embeddings joined to messages; never add WHERE to the HNSW LIMIT query (DuckDB VSS post-filters it). BgeEncoder drops only the Hub unauthenticated-request notice; other huggingface_hub _http warnings, incl. failed downloads, still log.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T195045Z-3d49f28ec61f9e73","text":"stockroom semantic --harness and --role rank embeddings joined to messages. Do not add WHERE to the HNSW LIMIT query; DuckDB VSS post-filters that shape.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T204959Z-929c764401ba7c67","text":"BgeEncoder drops the Hub unauthenticated-request notice. Other huggingface_hub.utils._http warnings, including a failed download, still log.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
